<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves fell to 70.93 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves fell to 70.93 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves fell to 70.93 billion ringgit as at April 30 against 71.81 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Friday. </p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities dropped to 95.67 billion ringgit from 96.97 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit)  Apr 30 1997     Apr 30 1996     Apr 15 1997</p>
<p>Reserves		 70.93	     64.98	     71.81</p>
<p>Assets		   95.67	     92.55	     96.97</p>
<p>Currency		 22.17	     19.60	     22.36</p>
<p>Govt paper		1.62		2.98		1.58</p>
